# {{pluginId}}

An RHDH dynamic frontend plugin using the New Frontend System.

## Development

```bash
yarn install
yarn build
yarn test
```

## Exporting

Export or package this plugin without adding the RHDH CLI to this project:

```bash
npx @red-hat-developer-hub/cli plugin export
npx @red-hat-developer-hub/cli plugin package --export-to ./plugin-registry
```

RHDH Dynamic Plugin Factory is the preferred workflow for repeatable build and packaging automation.
